            <profile id="94d9-00a5-71b7-0721" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All have hand weapon, thrusting spear and shield. Shieldwall. They may have large shield (+1) and darts (+1). Regular units may have light armour (+2). All may use Combined Formation with up to half the unit’s figures exchanging thrusting spear and shield for composite bow (-1) and forming the rear ranks. Irregulars are Levies.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
